 the leaf off","把叶子切断（分离）"],["Next time","下次"],["in action","在起作用；在运转"],["With the help of","在……的帮助下"]],"qs":[{"type":"main","q":"What does the passage mainly explain?","qz":"","o":["Why leaves change color and fall in autumn.","How to grow maple trees.","Why carrots are orange.","How people make sugar."],"a":0,"e":"全文解释秋天树叶变色和落叶的原因。"},{"type":"detail","q":"What do leaves use chlorophyll for?","qz":"","o":["To make food for the tree.","To keep the tree warm.","To turn the leaves red.","To protect the tree from insects."],"a":0,"e":"第二段：Leaves use chlorophyll to make food for the tree."},{"type":"vocab","q":"\"As the green slowly disappears, the yellow and orange colors finally show.\" Here \"show\" means ____.","qz":"","o":["can be seen","a TV program","to teach someone","to hide"],"a":0,"e":"这里 show 是动词\"显现、露出来\"，绿色褪去后黄色、橙色就能被看见了。"},{"type":"infer","q":"Which autumn will probably have the brightest red leaves?","qz":"","o":["One with sunny days and cool nights.","One with rainy days and warm nights.","One with very little sunlight.","One with freezing nights every day."],"a":0,"e":"第五段：Sunny days and cool (but not freezing) nights help them produce bright red leaves."},{"type":"tf","q":"The yellow and orange substances appear in leaves only in autumn.","qz":"","o":["True","False"],"a":1,"e":"第三段：They are there all year, hidden under the green.（它们一年四季都在，只是被绿色盖住了。）"}]}